{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04552","headline":"送郭大夫元振再使吐蕃 · 张说","name":"送郭大夫元振再使吐蕃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犬戎废东献，汉使驰西极。\n长策问酋渠，猜阻自夷殛。\n容髪徂边岁，旌裘敝海色。\n五年一见家，妻子不相识。\n武库兵犹动，金方事未息。\n远图待才智，苦节输筋力。\n脱刀赠分手，书带加餐食。\n知君万里侯，立功在异域。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}